  "passage": "Welcome to the Riverside School Computer Gaming Club! We meet every Thursday after school in the computer lab. Our club is open to all students, and we focus on playing and learning about different video games. This term, we are exploring a new game where players must defeat monsters in a virtual world. It's exciting and challenging! We manage our sessions carefully to ensure everyone gets a turn to play and learn. Neither beginners nor experienced players will feel left out, as we have games for all skill levels. Our club leader, Mr. Smith, helps us improve our skills and finally, we often have mini-tournaments with prizes. If you love computers and gaming, come and join us! You can appear at the lab on Thursday at 4 PM. Don't forget to bring your enthusiasm. We look forward to seeing you there.",
